  "title": "Never underestimate the power of exposure events — in the context of sequential testing",
  "summary": "Exposure events define the entry point of an experiment, yet they are often treated as an implementation detail. This article explores why exposure plays a central role in sequential testing, how different exposure choices affect denominators and bias, and how recent changes in Amplitude allowed us to better align experiment results with our product goals.",
